title: "SynthItaly: an agent-based simulator of Italian consumer bank transactions"
abstract: >-
  An agent-based model of what an Italian bank would see on its consumer
  customers' accounts, with validation against three published
  consumer-credit papers. Code accompanying a master's thesis.
